WEBVTT

00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:05.863
A trainer has to turn a procedure into
a graded course the LMS can track,

00:00:05.863 --> 00:00:09.862
and know the package works
before anyone uploads it.

00:00:09.862 --> 00:00:13.715
Scrimshaw builds the course,
drafts the first quiz

00:00:13.715 --> 00:00:17.414
through Fairlead,
and publishes a SCORM package.

00:00:17.414 --> 00:00:22.831
The procedure and the learner are
synthetic, and the LMS is a stand-in.

00:00:23.081 --> 00:00:24.912
It all runs on this one computer.

00:00:24.912 --> 00:00:28.988
Launch dot bat starts a small
PowerShell server on loopback,

00:00:28.988 --> 00:00:32.112
and the editor and player
run in your browser.

00:00:32.812 --> 00:00:38.630
Courses autosave in browser storage,
with a dot scrim file for backup.

00:00:39.130 --> 00:00:40.000
In: slides you build, PowerPoint,
